meta {
  name: 01 Challenge
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/auth/challenge
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "username": "malik",
    "deviceId": "{{device_id}}"
  }
}

docs {
  # 01 Challenge — Initiate Device Login

  Generates a cryptographically secure random challenge (32 bytes, base64url)
  that the device must sign with its Ed25519 private key.

  ## Response
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "challengeId": "uuid",
      "challenge": "base64url-challenge",
      "expiresAt": "2025-05-29T12:05:00.000Z"
    }
  }

  ## After this request:
  1. Copy `data.challengeId` → {{challenge_id}}
  2. On the device: sign the challenge with your Ed25519 private key
  3. Base64url-encode the signature
  4. Proceed to 02 Login
}
